activity Define Requirements
activity Develop Initial Prototype
activity Test Prototype
activity Gather Feedback
activity Analyze Feedback
activity Revise Prototype
activity Final Testing
activity Present Prototype
activity Approve Prototype
bind Gather Feedback: Stakeholder Name, Feedback Rating
bind Analyze Feedback: Stakeholder Name, Feedback Rating
bind Revise Prototype: Improvement Cost, Revision Version
bind Test Prototype: Test Result
bind Final Testing: Test Result
Stakeholder Name: John Doe, Jane Smith, Alice Johnson
Feedback Rating: integer between 1 and 10
Improvement Cost: float between 100.0 and 10000.0
Revision Version: integer between 1 and 20
Test Result: Pass, Fail
Init[Define Requirements] | |
End[Approve Prototype] | |
Existence2[Test Prototype] | |
Chain Response[Present Prototype, Approve Prototype] | | |
Precedence[Develop Initial Prototype, Define Requirements] | | |
Precedence[Test Prototype, Develop Initial Prototype] | | |
Precedence[Gather Feedback, Test Prototype] | | |
Precedence[Analyze Feedback, Gather Feedback] | | |
Precedence[Revise Prototype, Analyze Feedback] | | |
Precedence[Final Testing, Revise Prototype] | | |
Precedence[Present Prototype, Final Testing] | | |
Precedence[Approve Prototype, Present Prototype] | | |